node_modules/
*.node
# index.js + index.d.ts (the napi-rs loader + type defs) ARE committed: they're
# platform-independent, change only with the #[napi] surface, and the npm-publish
# job needs them in the checkout (it never runs `napi build`). A drift guard in
# the `node` CI job (`napi build` → `git diff --exit-code`) keeps them current.
